sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant W as Worker/API Domain Flow
  participant NS as NotificationService
  participant DB as MongoDB
  participant S as Socket.IO
  participant C as Client useAppSockets
  participant N as NotificationNav
  participant R as Related Page

  W->>W: Complete business operation
  W->>NS: createNotification(userId, payload)
  NS->>DB: Insert notification
  DB-->>NS: Saved notification
  NS->>S: emit notification:created to user room
  S-->>C: notification:created
  C->>N: Upsert notification and unread count

  N->>N: User opens dropdown
  Note over N: Opening does not mark read

  N->>NS: PATCH /notifications/:id/read
  NS->>DB: Set unread=false, readAt=now
  DB-->>NS: Updated notification
  NS-->>N: Updated notification

  alt Notification has actionUrl
    N->>R: Navigate to actionUrl
    alt actionUrl includes highlight id
      R->>R: Temporarily highlight related entity
    end
  else No actionUrl
    N->>N: Stay on current page
  end
